  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Call ODA Compliant Awards 2016/2017 - The Value of Culture in Conflict - Investigating the Sustainable Livelihood Generation for Craftswomen in Azad Kashmir (Pakistan)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research project establishing a framework to advance how we talk about the value of culturally valued creative activities within regions of intense conflict. Beneficiaries: policy-makers, practitioners &amp; civil society actors in Pakistan. SDGs:11,16,8</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
